# Memory Management and Serialization Enhancements

This commit adds comprehensive memory management and serialization capabilities to microPOSIX:

## Memory Management Features

### Zero-Copy Memory Views
- `mp_memory_view_t`: Efficient buffer access without copying
- `mp_memory_slice_t`: Typed memory slices with element counts
- `mp_memory_arena_t`: Bulk allocation with zero-copy slicing
- Functions: slice, copy, compare, find patterns, overlap detection

### Shared Heap Memory
- Thread-safe allocation with mutex protection
- Allocation tracking with source file and line information
- Comprehensive statistics (used, free, peak, fragmentation)
- Defragmentation support
- Global shared heap instance

### Garbage Collection
- Reference counting (deterministic, O(1) overhead)
- Mark-and-sweep (handles cycles)
- Generational GC (optimized for embedded)
- Finalizers for cleanup code
- Root tracking and object pinning
- Global GC instance with convenience macros

### Memory Pools & Arenas
- Enhanced existing pool and TLSF allocators
- Better error handling and memory tracking

## Serialization Features

### JSON
- Full JSON parser and generator
- Support for all JSON types (null, boolean, number, string, object, array)
- Pretty printing, custom allocators
- File I/O support
- Deep copy and equality comparison

### Protocol Buffers
- Varint, fixed32/64, length-delimited encoding/decoding
- All protobuf wire types
- Zig-zag encoding for signed integers
- Field header encoding/decoding
- Message encoding/decoding with descriptors

### EDF (Extensible Data Format)
- Compact binary serialization optimized for embedded systems
- Type-safe encoding/decoding
- Support for nested structures
- Zero-copy reading where possible
- Schema evolution support
- Schema registry

### OData (Open Data Protocol)
- OData v4.0 protocol support
- Entity model definition
- Query option parsing ($filter, $select, $orderby, $top, $skip, $count)
- OData JSON format support
- Entity set operations
- Navigation properties
- Complex types and collections
- Metadata document generation
- Service document generation

